WEBVTT
 
00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
Tommy Grant is a taxi driver in London. 

00:03.000 --> 00:04.950
He works for TOP TAXIS.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.300
One day, Tommy's boss, Sam, telephones him. 

00:08.400 --> 00:10.950
It is very early in the morning.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.950
Tommy, says Sam. Can you be at The Ritz Hotel at 9:00 o'clock?

00:16.000 --> 00:19.550
Yes, says Tommy, but why?

00:20.000 --> 00:24.950
Sam and his wife are having breakfast with their children, Billy and Katy.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.950
Gloria Brash is in London, says Sam.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.300
Gloria Brash! says Tommy. 

00:32.400 --> 00:34.170
The film star! 

00:34.250 --> 00:36.370
Where do you want me to drive her?

00:37.000 --> 00:40.700
Not her, says Sam. Him.

00:40.900 --> 00:44.600
Her 12-year-old son Dino wants to see London today. 

00:44.700 --> 00:46.250
His mother's working.

00:46.400 --> 00:48.780
There's a letter for you at The Ritz. 

00:48.900 --> 00:52.000
There's 50 pounds, too. That's for Dino.

00:52.100 --> 00:56.800
50 pounds for one day in London! says Tommy. 

00:56.900 --> 00:58.950
That's a lot of money.

00:59.000 --> 01:05.950
I know, says Sam. Be very nice to the boy, Tommy, and don't be late.

01:06.000 --> 01:10.180
You know me, says Tommy. I'm always early.

01:11.000 --> 01:15.950
It is 8:45. Tommy is at The Ritz 15 minutes early. 

01:16.000 --> 01:17.950
He goes to the desk.

01:18.000 --> 01:20.950
I'm from TOP TAXIS, he says.

01:21.000 --> 01:24.950
The woman behind the desk gives him the letter and the money.

01:25.000 --> 01:29.650
The letter says, It's Dino's first time in London.

01:30.000 --> 01:32.950
Please take him to all these places.

01:33.000 --> 01:40.950
One, Buckingham Palace. Two, Harrods. Three, the British Museum.

01:41.000 --> 01:45.900
OK, thinks Tommy. Now, is Dino here? 

01:46.000 --> 01:50.950
I know I'm early, but he sees a boy in a chair.

01:51.000 --> 01:54.420
Hello, he says. Are you Dino? 

01:54.500 --> 01:57.050
That's me, says the boy.

01:57.150 --> 02:02.000
Are you the driver from TOP TAXIS? Yes, answers Tommy. 

02:02.100 --> 02:03.950
The boy stands up.

02:04.000 --> 02:07.200
OK, he says. Let's go. 

02:07.300 --> 02:10.550
First, Tommy drives to Buckingham Palace.

02:10.600 --> 02:14.000
The home of the Queen. He stops the taxi.

02:14.100 --> 02:22.050
What are you doing? asks Dino. 

02:22.100 --> 02:24.850
I don't want to see this old place.

02:24.900 --> 02:26.900
Tommy looks at him. 

02:27.000 --> 02:30.900
But I, then he remembers Sam's words.

02:31.000 --> 02:34.050
Be very nice to the boy.

02:34.100 --> 02:37.650
OK, Dino, he says. 

02:37.750 --> 02:39.950
Where do you want to go?

02:43.000 --> 02:46.550
Five minutes later, Tommy stops the taxi again.

02:46.600 --> 02:49.550
Is this the place? He asks. 

02:49.650 --> 02:52.120
That's right, answers Dino.

02:52.220 --> 02:54.650
Can I have 20 pounds, please?

02:54.700 --> 03:00.150
But I don't think your mother. I want 20 pounds now.

03:00.200 --> 03:02.750
Tommy gives Dino the money. 

03:02.850 --> 03:05.350
Then he sits in the car and waits.

03:05.800 --> 03:11.000
Three hours later, Dino comes back.

03:11.200 --> 03:15.150
Now, are you hungry? asks Tommy. 

03:15.250 --> 03:19.550
Yes, I am, answers Dino. Very hungry.

03:19.600 --> 03:21.900
Tommy drives to Harrods. 

03:22.000 --> 03:25.900
There's a very good restaurant in this shop, he says.

03:26.000 --> 03:29.600
I don't want to eat here! says Dino. 

03:29.700 --> 03:32.500
I want to have lunch there.

03:32.900 --> 03:36.950
Where? asks Tommy. He looks across the road.

03:37.000 --> 03:42.950
Dino goes into the Big Burger Bar with another 20 pounds.

03:43.000 --> 03:47.950
He eats a mountain of food and drinks four milkshakes.

03:48.000 --> 03:54.800
Tommy eats his lunch in the taxi. 20 pounds for lunch! he thinks.

03:54.900 --> 03:57.950
I can buy a week's food with 20 pounds.

03:58.000 --> 04:02.250
He looks out of the window and eats another sandwich.

04:02.300 --> 04:06.080
An hour later, Dino comes out of the restaurant.

04:06.180 --> 04:11.750
Be very nice to the boy, thinks Tommy.

04:11.900 --> 04:16.950
Do you want to go to the British Museum now? he asks.

04:17.000 --> 04:21.200
OK, answers Dino. Tommy looks at him.

04:21.300 --> 04:25.130
Yes! Tommy is very happy. 

04:25.230 --> 04:29.100
He drives to the British Museum and gives Dino 10 pounds.

04:29.200 --> 04:32.600
Thanks, says Dino. Wait here.

04:32.700 --> 04:41.950
Then he goes into a cinema across the road from the museum.

04:43.000 --> 04:46.500
At 4:15, Dino comes out of the cinema.

04:46.600 --> 04:51.500
Tommy's sitting in the cab. He's very angry.

04:52.000 --> 04:57.600
Where do you want to go now? he asks.

04:57.700 --> 05:01.650
Oh, back to The Ritz, I think, says Dino.

05:01.700 --> 05:05.400
I'm tired and I want to have a bath before dinner.

05:05.500 --> 05:10.650
Good, thinks Tommy. Tommy starts the car again.

05:11.000 --> 05:16.850
At 4:30, Tommy stops in front of the hotel.

05:16.950 --> 05:19.600
Here we are, he says. 

05:19.700 --> 05:21.800
He opens the door for Dino.

05:21.900 --> 05:27.300
Then he sees a beautiful woman in a very expensive coat.

05:27.400 --> 05:31.150
She's walking out of The Ritz and she's looking at him.

05:31.200 --> 05:34.100
I know that woman, thinks Tommy.

05:34.200 --> 05:40.850
Then he remembers. Of course, it's Gloria Brash!

05:42.900 --> 05:47.650
Are you the man from TOP TAXIS? asks Gloria.

05:47.750 --> 05:53.800
Yes, says Tommy. Come with me, says the film star.

05:53.900 --> 05:56.050
She walks back into the hotel.

05:56.100 --> 06:00.000
There, Tommy sees a boy sitting in a chair. 

06:00.100 --> 06:02.000
He looks very sad.

06:02.100 --> 06:06.400
This is Dino, she says.

06:06.500 --> 06:09.950
But, but Tommy can't speak.

06:10.000 --> 06:15.000
I am very angry, says Gloria.

06:16.000 --> 06:21.950
Tommy looks at the boy, at the film star, and at the young boy again.

06:22.000 --> 06:25.850
But this can't be Dino! he says.

06:25.900 --> 06:30.340
Young man, I know my son! answers Gloria.

06:30.450 --> 06:33.950
Now, where is my 50 pounds?

06:34.000 --> 06:36.950
Tommy's face goes white. 

06:37.000 --> 06:38.750
He looks out of the window.

06:38.800 --> 06:44.950
His taxi is there, but Dino is not.

06:45.000 --> 06:48.150
It is 5:00 o'clock in the afternoon.

06:48.200 --> 06:50.700
Tommy's boss, Sam, is at home.

06:50.800 --> 06:54.100
He and his wife are having a cup of tea.

06:54.200 --> 06:58.000
The door opens and their son, Billy, walks in.

06:58.100 --> 07:03.200
Hello, Billy, says Sam. Good day at school?

07:03.300 --> 07:05.800
Billy looks very happy.

07:05.900 --> 07:10.000
Yes, thanks, he says. Very good.
